Our mission is to help companies improve or start their operations with China and Asia.

We already do business with countries in Asia, Africa, Europe and across America, and our suppliers are mainly located in China, Hong Kong, Taiwan, India, Vietnam, Pakistan and Brazil.

At China Link Trading, your project is customized, and our team is committed to finding the perfect supplier for your merchandise, giving your import the perfect result.

Our services include:
- Sourcing and purchasing in Asia;
- Product development;
- Import and Export between Brazil and China;
- Factory audits and inspections;
- Logistics and International Transport;
- Purchasing management;
- Cargo consolidation;
- Quality control;
- Planning of Fairs and Business Trips;
- Obtaining the Chinese visa;
- Interpreters and accompaniments;

